        "accession_number": "0001007587-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For both maritime and onshore customers who want to access live television while on the move, we offer a comprehensive family of parabolic mobile satellite antenna products marketed under the TracVision brand.",
        "start_character": 5839,
        "end_character": 6048
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001007587-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001007587-26-000004-ba956cc3cf7ff90f",
        "accession_number": "0001007587-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For customer access to our airtime services, we currently offer a family of parabolic hybrid mobile satellite antenna products, which are marketed under the TracNet hybrid terminal network brand.",
        "start_character": 4855,
        "end_character": 5050
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001007587-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001007587-26-000004-ba956cc3cf7ff90f",
        "accession_number": "0001007587-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For mobile access to the Internet and VoIP services, which we refer to collectively as our airtime services, we offer communication services using global satellite service (including Ku-band VSAT using the SES HTS network along with Starlink, Eutelsat OneWeb, Iridium, Inmarsat and other satellite services), 5G/LTE cellular service, and shore-based Wi-Fi access, which are marketed under the KVH ONE hybrid network brand.",
        "start_character": 4432,
        "end_character": 4854
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001007587-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001007587-26-000004-ba956cc3cf7ff90f",
        "accession_number": "0001007587-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In February 2024, we announced a staged wind-down of our product manufacturing operations at our Middletown, Rhode Island location.",
        "start_character": 6620,
        "end_character": 6751
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001007587-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001007587-26-000004-ba956cc3cf7ff90f",
        "accession_number": "0001007587-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In October 2023, we signed a multi-year agreement with Kognitive Networks through which we are integrating Kognitive’s suite of enterprise-grade network and bandwidth management tools, private-labeled as CommBox Edge, into our maritime mobile communication service offerings.",
        "start_character": 13051,
        "end_character": 13326
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001007587-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001007587-26-000004-ba956cc3cf7ff90f",
        "accession_number": "0001007587-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we currently manufacture and distribute a comprehensive family of mobile satellite antenna products that provide two-way access to the Internet and VoIP services using Ku-band VSAT service with integrated 5G/LTE cellular service and support for shore-based Wi-Fi.",
        "start_character": 3751,
        "end_character": 4027
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001007587-26-000004",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001007587-26-000004-ba956cc3cf7ff90f",
        "accession_number": "0001007587-26-000004",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-10",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we face some competition from providers of low-speed data services, which include Viasat/Inmarsat and Iridium.",
